OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Araping 16-year-old girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fraping a 16-year-old girl on the West
OL,8,FSussex coast, police say.
OL,10,FThe alleged offence is believed to have
OL,11,Ftaken place on Marine Drive West in
OL,12,FBognor Regis during the early hours of
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FThe man, aged 20, currently remains in
OL,16,Fcustody, and the victim is being
OL,17,Fsupported by specialist trained
OL,18,Fofficers.
OL,20,FSussex Police is appealing for anyone
OL,21,Fwith any information that might assist
OL,22,Fits investigation to get in touch.
